  "description_en": "Creates a custom media processing template",
  "description_zh": "本接口允许用户创建自定义的媒体处理模板",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun ice create-custom-template --name test-template --type 1 --template-config Container_:_Format_:_flv_,_Video_:_,_Audio_: --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": false,
  "name": "CreateCustomTemplate",
  "operation": {
    "action": "CreateCustomTemplate",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2020-11-09",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "readAndWrite",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "test-template",
      "help_en": "The template name",
      "help_zh": "模板名称",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "name",
      "options": [
        "--name"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Name",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The templatetype. Valid values:\n1: transcoding template\n2: snapshot template\n3: animated image template\n4: image watermark template\n5: text watermark template\n6: subtitle template\n7: AI intelligent review\n8: AI intelligent cover\n9: AI intelligent erasure\n10: AI intelligent DNA template\n11: AI intelligent label template",
      "help_zh": "模板类型。\n1：转码模板\n2：截图模板\n3：动图模板\n4：图片水印模板\n5：文字水印模板\n6：字幕模板\n7：AI智能审核\n8：AI智能封面\n9：AI智能擦除\n10：AI智能DNA模板\n11：AI智能标签模板",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "type",
      "options": [
        "--type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Type",
      "required": true,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The template subtype.\n\nTranscoding template subtypes:\n1: normal transcoding template (Normal)\n2: audio transcoding template (AudioTranscode)\n3: container format conversion (Remux)\n4: Narrowband HD 1.0 (NarrowBandV1)\n5: Narrowband HD 2.0 (NarrowBandV2)\n\nSnapshot template subtypes:\n1: normal snapshot/static snapshot (Normal)\n2: sprite snapshot (Sprite)\n3: WebVTT snapshot (WebVtt)\n\nAI review template subtypes:\n1: video review (Video) \n2: audio review (Audio)\n3: image review (Image)\n\nAI intelligent erasure template subtypes:\n1: logo erasure (VideoDelogo)\n2: subtitle erasure (VideoDetext)",
      "help_zh": "模板子类型。\n\n转码模板子类型：\n1：普通转码模板（Normal）\n2：音频转码模板（AudioTranscode）\n3：转封装（Remux）\n4：窄带高清1.0（NarrowBandV1）\n5：窄带高清2.0（NarrowBandV2）\n\n截图模板子类型：\n1：普通截图/静态截图（Normal）\n2：雪碧图（Sprite）\n3：WebVtt截图（WebVtt）\n\nAI审核模板子类型：\n1：视频审核（Video） \n2：音频审核（Audio）\n3：图片审核（Image）\n\nAI智能擦除模板子类型：\n1：图标擦除（VideoDelogo）\n2：字幕擦除（VideoDetext）",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "subtype",
      "options": [
        "--subtype"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Subtype",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "{\"Container\":{\"Format\":\"flv\"},\"Video\":{},\"Audio\":{}}",
      "help_en": "The template configuration. For detailed metric description, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/448291.html",
      "help_zh": "模板配置。详细参数说明请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/448291.html",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "template_config",
      "options": [
        "--template-config"
      ],
      "raw_name": "TemplateConfig",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
